#: ../../peps/peps/pep-0291.rst:133
msgid ""
"The email package version 2 was distributed with Python up to Python 2.3, "
"and this must remain Python 2.1 compatible.  email package version 3 will be "
"distributed with Python 2.4 and will need to remain compatible only with "
"Python 2.3."
msgstr ""

#: ../../peps/peps/pep-0291.rst:138
msgid ""
"Specification updates will be treated as bugfixes and backported. Python 2.3 "
"compatibility will be kept for at least Python 2.4. The decision will be "
"revisited for Python 2.5 and not changed unless compelling advantages arise."
msgstr ""

#: ../../peps/peps/pep-0291.rst:143
msgid ""
"pybench lives under the Tools/ directory. Compatibility with older Python "
"versions is needed in order to be able to compare performance between Python "
"versions. New features may still be used in new tests, which may then be "
"configured to fail gracefully on import by the tool in older Python versions."
msgstr ""

